# Authors

CoreFrame was created by **RoftCore**, and every commit in this repository is
theirs: the baseline project and the whole 1.1.0 line (permissions, process
isolation, autoruns, the scale pass, the marketplace and the runner).

## Copyright holder

    RoftCore <roftcore@gmail.com>

## Contributors

None yet. Because the copyright is held in full by a single party, the project
can be relicensed, dual-licensed or sold as a whole without asking anyone else.

That stays true only while every external contribution goes through the CLA in
`CONTRIBUTING.md`. A merged pull request without it would make a third party
co-owner of their part, and from that day the license of the project is no
longer something the maintainer can decide alone.
